#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:155
msgid "Our men outflanked them: the troops beyond the line fall on their flank."
msgstr "Naši su ih obuhvatili s boka: trupe van linije udaraju im u bok."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:155
msgid "They outflanked us: their troops beyond the line fall on our flank."
msgstr "Obuhvatili su nas s boka: njihove trupe van linije udaraju nam u bok."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:157
msgid "Our men closed a pincer on both their flanks."
msgstr "Naši su ih stegli kleštima s oba boka."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:157
msgid "They closed a pincer on both our flanks."
msgstr "Stegli su nas kleštima s oba boka."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:159
msgid "Our men surrounded them."
msgstr "Naši su ih opkolili."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:159
msgid "They surrounded us."
msgstr "Opkolili su nas."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:162
msgid "Our men cut down their surplus and broke through!"
msgstr "Naši su posekli njihov višak i izvršili proboj!"

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:162
msgid "They cut down our surplus and broke through!"
msgstr "Posekli su naš višak i izvršili proboj!"

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:173
msgid "a neighbour"
msgstr "suseda"

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:175
msgid "They are still building their engines: only the archers of both sides shoot."
msgstr "Još grade opsadne sprave: gađaju samo strelci obe strane."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:177
msgid "The gates opened and our men charged out: the walls play no part any more."
msgstr "Kapije su se otvorile i naši su jurnuli napolje: zidine više ne igraju ulogu."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:179
msgid "It opened with an exchange of arrows at the front line."
msgstr "Bitka je počela razmenom strela po prvoj liniji."

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:182
msgid "harried the flank"
msgstr "uznemiravanje boka"

#: client/scripts/game/battle_story.gd:182
msgid "struck from behind"
