#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:271
msgid "An army marches to the edge of the map on a front's side and goes into the enemy's lands: it fights a battle on each field it crosses, then besieges the front's stronghold, and comes home with what it carries. A battle lost turns it home with what it has. Every battle won makes that front's next horde hate you the more. It eats its own grain all the way: military caravans carry more, and more loot."
msgstr "Vojska maršira do ivice mape na strani jednog fronta i ulazi u neprijateljske zemlje: bije bitku na svakom polju koje pređe, zatim opseda utvrđenje tog fronta i vraća se kući s onim što nosi. Izgubljena bitka je vraća kući s onim što ima. Svaka dobijena bitka čini da vas sledeća horda tog fronta više mrzi. Celim putem jede svoje žito: vojni karavani nose više, i više plena."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:274
msgid "Raid a front"
msgstr "Pohod na front"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_army.gd:275
msgid "Into a front's lands: a battle on each field, then its stronghold; loot comes home."
msgstr "U zemlje jednog fronta: bitka na svakom polju, pa njegovo uporište; plen se nosi kući."

