#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:582
msgid "A grain store for armies (%d grain)"
msgstr "Zalihe žita za vojske (%d žita)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:583
msgid "Armies standing here fill up from its grain, and can leave grain here. A supply route keeps it stocked by caravan. A horde passing close burns it unless an army stands on it."
msgstr "Vojske koje ovde stoje uzimaju njeno žito i mogu ovde ostaviti svoje. Put snabdevanja je puni karavanima. Horda koja prođe blizu je spaljuje, osim ako na njoj stoji vojska."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:585
msgid "Build a fort (+%d%% defense here)"
msgstr "Izgradi utvrdu (+%d%% odbrane ovde)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:586
msgid "A fort starts with its Keep and Storage at level 1 and grows from there: walls in three rings and towers on them. It eats grain; with no grain and no army holding it for %d hours, bandits take it."
msgstr "Utvrda počinje sa Kulom i Skladištem na nivou 1 i raste odatle: zidine u tri prstena i kule na njima. Troši žito; bez žita i bez vojske koja je drži %d sati, razbojnici je zauzimaju."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:590
msgid "Build supply point"
msgstr "Izgradi žitnicu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:590
msgid "Build fort"
msgstr "Izgradi utvrdu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:621
msgid "Being built: ready in %s"
msgstr "Gradi se: gotovo za %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:624
msgid "Grain: %d of %d"
msgstr "Žito: %d od %d"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:627
msgid "%s · eats %s a game hour"
msgstr "%s · troši %s po satu igre"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:628
msgid "A fort eats grain every hour, more with a bigger Keep. Armies and caravans fill its Storage. With no grain and no army holding it for %d game hours, bandits take it."
msgstr "Utvrda troši žito svakog sata, više sa većom Kulom. Vojske i karavani pune njeno Skladište. Bez žita i bez vojske koja je drži %d sati igre, razbojnici je zauzimaju."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:634
msgid "No grain and nobody holds it: bandits take it in %s"
msgstr "Nema žita i niko je ne drži: razbojnici je zauzimaju za %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:641
msgid "Defenders: %s"
msgstr "Branioci: %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:642
msgid "The Fort Garrison's own defenders never leave the fort and fight in its battles, even with no army there. While the fort has grain, one fallen defender comes back every %s game hours; with no grain they desert."
msgstr "Branioci Posade utvrde nikad ne napuštaju utvrdu i bore se u njenim bitkama, i kad tamo nema vojske. Dok utvrda ima žita, jedan pali branilac se vraća svakih %s sati igre; bez žita dezertiraju."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:644
msgid "Zone of influence: %d hexes"
msgstr "Zona uticaja: %d polja"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:645
msgid "Its village can reshape the land and build roads anywhere within this many hexes of the fort, as near its own walls. The Keep widens it."
msgstr "Njeno selo može da preoblikuje zemlju i gradi puteve bilo gde na ovoliko polja od utvrde, kao kraj svojih zidina. Kula je širi."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:652
msgid "Rally point: troops trained in your settlements march here to hold it once done."
msgstr "Zborno mesto: vojnici obučeni u tvojim naseljima dolaze ovde da je drže čim budu spremni."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:652
msgid "Not your rally point"
msgstr "Nije tvoje zborno mesto"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:658
msgid "Tap again to tear it down: its grain is lost"
msgstr "Dodirni ponovo da je srušiš: njeno žito propada"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:658
msgid "Tear down the supply point"
msgstr "Sruši žitnicu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:658
msgid "Tear down the fort"
msgstr "Sruši utvrdu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:686
msgid "Rising: %s %d, done in %s"
msgstr "Gradi se: %s %d, gotovo za %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:709
msgid "%s, level %d"
msgstr "%s, nivo %d"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:723
msgid "Build"
msgstr "Gradi"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:723
msgid "Raise"
msgstr "Podigni"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:782
msgid "Towards (%d, %d): "
msgstr "Prema (%d, %d): "

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:785
msgid "a bridge crosses here."
msgstr "ovde prolazi most."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:788
