msgid "SW"
msgstr "JZ"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:825
msgid "SE"
msgstr "JI"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:835
msgid " (being built)"
msgstr " (u gradnji)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:835
msgid " (being improved)"
msgstr " (poboljšava se)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:835
msgid " (being repaired)"
msgstr " (popravlja se)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:837
msgid " (damaged)"
msgstr " (oštećen)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:846
msgid "Roads speed the march for everyone on them, the human hordes too, but the beasts of the North keep off them. A dirt track, a stone road and a paved road are each faster; the march takes %s of the time."
msgstr "Putevi ubrzavaju marš svima na njima, i ljudskim hordama, ali zveri Severa ih izbegavaju. Zemljani, kameni i popločan put su svaki brži; marš traje %s vremena."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:848
msgid "Roads run %s."
msgstr "Putevi vode %s."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:850
msgid "Fire damaged a road here"
msgstr "Vatra je oštetila put ovde"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:851
msgid "A damaged road saves only %d%% of the time it would, and adds only %d%% of its bonus to outposts, until it is repaired. Repairing costs %d%% of its level's price and time; it can't be improved before."
msgstr "Oštećen put štedi samo %d%% vremena koje bi inače uštedeo i daje ispostavama samo %d%% svog bonusa, dok se ne popravi. Popravka košta %d%% cene i vremena njegovog nivoa; pre toga se ne može poboljšati."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:864
msgid "Repair"
msgstr "Popravi"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:864
msgid "Improve"
msgstr "Poboljšaj"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:876
msgid "Repair the %s %s: %s · %s"
msgstr "Popravi %s (%s): %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:877
msgid "%s to a %s: %s · %s"
msgstr "%s u %s: %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:890
msgid "A mountain pass: %s · %s"
msgstr "Planinski prolaz: %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:892
msgid "A road into the mountains costs and takes %d times as much. Armies, caravans and scouts then cross the mountain along it, slowly; none can stop there, and the hordes keep off the passes."
msgstr "Put kroz planine košta i traje %d puta više. Vojske, karavani i izviđači tada prelaze planinu njime, sporo; niko tamo ne može da stane, a horde se klone prolaza."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:893
msgid "Build a road"
msgstr "Izgradi put"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:897
msgid "Tap the hex next to this one to build the road to."
msgstr "Dodirni susedno polje do kog ide put."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:904
msgid "A road: %s · %s"
msgstr "Put: %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:960
msgid "Grain the army takes from the granary to eat on the way. When it runs out the army goes hungry: it marches slower and then loses soldiers. It can fill up again in your villages, forts and supply points."
msgstr "Žito koje vojska uzima iz žitnice da jede usput. Kad ga nestane, vojska gladuje: maršira sporije, a zatim gubi vojnike. Može se ponovo snabdeti u tvojim selima, utvrđenjima i tačkama snabdevanja."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:970
msgid "Grain for the march: pick the troops first."
msgstr "Žito za marš: prvo izaberi trupe."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:971
msgid "Takes %d grain · lasts %s · they can carry %d"
msgstr "Nosi %d žita · traje %s · mogu da ponesu %d"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1002
msgid "Nothing guards it: no fight."
msgstr "Niko ga ne čuva: nema borbe."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1005
msgid "Danger unknown: nobody has seen what guards it."
msgstr "Opasnost nepoznata: niko nije video šta ga čuva."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1006
msgid "Scouts sent alone count the guardians and turn back; then the odds show here."
msgstr "Izviđači poslati sami prebroje čuvare i vrate se; tada se ovde vide izgledi."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1010
msgid "A guess from %d fights played out with what you know: the enemy's numbers (who exactly is among them is guessed from their front), your troops, their stance and your bonuses. Heroes and generals are not counted."
msgstr "Procena iz %d odigranih borbi sa onim što znaš: broj neprijatelja (ko je tačno među njima pretpostavlja se po njihovom frontu), tvoje trupe, njihov stav i tvoji bonusi. Heroji i generali se ne računaju."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1015
msgid "%d enemies there."
msgstr "Tamo je %d neprijatelja."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1028
msgid "Your armies standing elsewhere"
msgstr "Tvoje vojske koje stoje drugde"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1036
msgid "Move here"
msgstr "Pomeri ovamo"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1066
msgid "Settlers on their way to found %s · %s"
msgstr "Doseljenici na putu da osnuju %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1068
msgid "Settlers coming home (%s) · %s"
msgstr "Doseljenici se vraćaju kući (%s) · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1070
msgid "Founded %s"
msgstr "Osnovano %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1071
msgid "Settlers came home from (%d, %d)"
msgstr "Doseljenici su se vratili sa (%d, %d)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1091
msgid "On fire: nothing gets through · out in %s"
msgstr "Gori: ništa ne prolazi · gasi se za %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1092
msgid "Under way · done in %s"
msgstr "U toku · gotovo za %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1110
msgid "A village reshapes the land within %d hexes of it, or in the zone of influence of a fort it built, where nothing stands: paid at once, mostly in grain to feed the workers, and done after a while."
msgstr "Selo preoblikuje zemlju na %d polja od sebe, ili u zoni uticaja utvrde koju je izgradilo, gde ništa ne stoji: plaća se odmah, uglavnom žitom za radnike, i gotovo je posle nekog vremena."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1112
msgid "None of your villages is within %d hexes, nor any of your forts' zones."
msgstr "Nijedno tvoje selo nije na %d polja, niti je ovo u zoni neke tvoje utvrde."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1134
msgid "brings %s"
msgstr "donosi %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1135
msgid "%s → %s · %s · %s"
msgstr "%s → %s · %s · %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1140
msgid "The camp burns: %d–%d%% of its troops flee at once and march on the nearest village, and its front's hatred rises by %d%%."
msgstr "Logor gori: %d–%d%% njegovih trupa odmah beži i maršira na najbliže selo, a mržnja njegovog fronta raste za %d%%."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1148
msgid "No river here to dig on from"
msgstr "Ovde nema reke koja bi se mogla produžiti"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1150
msgid "Toward (%d, %d)"
msgstr "Prema (%d, %d)"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1166
msgid "Something stands there"
msgstr "Tu nešto stoji"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1168
msgid "An army stands there: no fire can be set"
msgstr "Tu stoji vojska: vatra se ne može podmetnuti"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1224
msgid "%d settlers from %s walk here and found it (%d at home). Train them in a Settlers' Lodge."
msgstr "%d doseljenika iz %s ide ovamo i osniva ga (%d kod kuće). Obučavaj ih u Loži doseljenika."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1229
msgid "Send settlers"
msgstr "Pošalji doseljenike"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1255
msgid "A %s here would gather %s."
msgstr "Ovde (%s) bi se sakupljalo %s."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1273
msgid "Claim"
msgstr "Prisvoji"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1314
msgid "Ally: %s"
msgstr "Saveznik: %s"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1322
msgid "Hero %s (Lv %d) leads the garrison"
msgstr "Junak %s (nivo %d) vodi posadu"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1325
msgid "Send resources"
msgstr "Pošalji resurse"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1334
msgid "Hall %d · Building %d/%d · Outposts %d/%d"
msgstr "Dom %d · Gradnja %d/%d · Ispostave %d/%d"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1337
msgid "Under siege: outposts produce nothing until the battle ends."
msgstr "Pod opsadom: ispostave ne proizvode ništa dok se bitka ne završi."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1339
msgid "In ruins: rebuild it from the village view."
msgstr "U ruševinama: obnovi ga iz prikaza sela."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1341
msgid "A refugee camp"
msgstr "Izbeglički logor"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1341
msgid "Hordes raid a refugee camp but never burn it."
msgstr "Horde pljačkaju izbeglički logor, ali ga nikad ne spale."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1345
msgid "Enter village"
msgstr "Uđi u selo"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1359
msgid "Merchants trade with another village or outpost, or the Holy City."
msgstr "Trgovci trguju sa drugim selom ili predstražom, ili sa Svetim gradom."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_map.gd:1374
msgid "A caravan can go to a village or outpost, the Holy City, a shipyard, or a fort or supply point."
msgstr "Karavan može da ide u selo ili ispostavu, Sveti grad, brodogradilište, ili utvrdu ili tačku snabdevanja."

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_messages.gd:20
msgid "%s builds nothing"
msgstr "%s ništa ne gradi"

#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_messages.gd:25
