#: client/scripts/screens/game_screen_threats.gd:591
msgid "The front's hatred grows with every ambush, harassing strike, raid and strike against its hordes, and every map event left undone. Its next horde to set out takes all of it, and the front's hatred starts again from nothing. Each time it passes another 100%%, the front's next horde sends a band of %d%% of its troops against the nearest village. A horde that took it leaves %s more camps behind when it is over (the whole part surely, the rest by chance). Ambushes on the front are riskier, and worth more."
msgstr "Mržnja strane raste sa svakom zasedom, svakim napadom uznemiravanja, pohodom i udarom na njene horde, i sa svakim događajem na mapi koji ostane nedovršen. Sledeća horda te strane koja krene uzima je svu, i mržnja strane kreće ispočetka. Svaki put kad pređe još 100%%, sledeća horda te strane šalje odred od %d%% svojih trupa na najbliže selo. Horda koja ju je uzela ostavlja za sobom još %s logora kad se završi (ceo deo sigurno, ostatak slučajno). Zasede na toj strani su rizičnije, i vrede više."

