#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of the Old Builders"
msgstr "Blagoslov starih graditelja"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The first builders sleep in the Builders' Barrow with their mark, the rune that bound the old span to Yav. Their dead still guard it: break through and bring the rune back, or no stone will hold the new span."
msgstr "Prvi graditelji počivaju u Graditeljskoj humci sa svojim znakom, runom koja je vezala stari luk za Jav. Njihovi mrtvi je i dalje čuvaju: probij se i vrati runu, ili nijedan kamen neće držati novi luk."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A road to Prav can't rise from common stone. The old builders were buried with the rune that made their stones remember the rite; only stones marked with it will carry the bridge on from Yav."
msgstr "Put do Prava ne može se podići od običnog kamena. Stari graditelji sahranjeni su s runom koja je činila da se njihovo kamenje seća obreda; samo kamenje obeleženo njome poneće most dalje od Java."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Oak Piers"
msgstr "Hrastovi stubovi"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of the Bridge Wrights"
msgstr "Blagoslov mostograditelja"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The sacred oaks stand over a den of Nav's beasts, grown fat on the grove's offerings. Clear the Den under the Sacred Oaks, or no volkhv will lift an axe in the grove."
msgstr "Sveti hrastovi stoje nad jazbinom Navovih zveri, ugojenih od žrtava iz gaja. Očisti Jazbinu pod svetim hrastovima, ili nijedan volhv neće podići sekiru u gaju."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The piers that lift the bridge towards Prav are cut from the sacred oaks, but Veles' beasts have made their den among the roots and nobody can fell a tree while they howl."
msgstr "Stubovi koji dižu most ka Pravu seku se od svetih hrastova, ali su Velesove zveri napravile jazbinu među korenjem i niko ne može oboriti drvo dok one zavijaju."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Iron Span"
msgstr "Gvozdeni raspon"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of Svarog's Forge"
msgstr "Blagoslov Svarogove kovačnice"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Nav knows the forge is lit. The Smith-Breakers, a host sworn to put out Svarog's flame, march on the Holy City apart from the hordes: beat them before the walls, and the iron can be forged."
msgstr "Nav zna da je kovačnica upaljena. Kovačolomci, vojska zakleta da ugasi Svarogov plamen, kreću na Sveti grad odvojeno od hordi: porazi ih pred zidinama i gvožđe može da se kuje."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Iron forged under Svarog's eye carries the road up into the sky. The forge in the Holy City must burn without break, and Nav will send its own to put it out."
msgstr "Gvožđe kovano pod Svarogovim okom nosi put u nebo. Kovačnica u Svetom gradu mora goreti bez prestanka, a Nav će poslati svoje da je ugase."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Guardian Rails"
msgstr "Ograda čuvara"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Blessing of Perun's Thunder"
msgstr "Blagoslov Perunovog groma"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Eye of Veles, the stone that sees every road from Nav, is kept in the North's deepest stronghold. Raid the North to its full depth, sack the stronghold and bring the Eye back: set in the rails, it shows the guardians everything that comes."
msgstr "Velesovo oko, kamen koji vidi svaki put iz Nava, čuva se u najdubljoj tvrđavi Severa. Prodri u Sever do kraja, opljačkaj tvrđavu i vrati Oko: postavljeno u ograde, pokazuje čuvarima sve što dolazi."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The rails are carved with the faces of guardians so that nothing from Nav can climb the new span to Prav; but guardians must see to guard, and only the Eye of Veles sees the roads of Nav."
msgstr "Ograde su izrezbarene licima čuvara da ništa iz Nava ne bi moglo da se popne na novi luk do Prava; ali čuvari moraju da vide da bi čuvali, a samo Velesovo oko vidi puteve Nava."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Ritual Arch"
msgstr "Obredni luk"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember: the volkhvs bind the arch with it, and without it the new span is only a road into Prav for the enemy."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara: volhvi njome vezuju luk, a bez nje novi raspon je samo put u Prav za neprijatelja."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The arch at the top of the span opens onto Prav. It is bound with a torc of Svarog's fire, and once it stands, everything in Nav will come at once: Ritual Night."
msgstr "Luk na vrhu raspona otvara se ka Pravi. Vezuje se grivnom od Svarogove vatre, i čim bude stajao, sve što je u Navi doći će odjednom: Obredna noć."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Builders' Rune"
msgstr "Graditeljska runa"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Explore the Builders' Barrow, deep in guardians, while this stage is open."
msgstr "Istraži Graditeljsku humku, punu čuvara, dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Den under the Sacred Oaks"
msgstr "Jazbina pod svetim hrastovima"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear the quest lair while this stage is open."
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu zadatka dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beat the Smith-Breakers"
msgstr "Porazi Kovačolomce"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beat the quest army marching on the Holy City."
msgstr "Porazi vojsku zadatka koja kreće na Sveti grad."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Eye of Veles"
msgstr "Velesovo oko"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Raid the North to its full depth and sack its stronghold while this stage is open."
msgstr "Prodri u Sever do kraja i opljačkaj njegovu tvrđavu dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Craft the ritual torc"
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Bring back a relic"
msgstr "Donesi relikviju"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Explore an ancient site while this stage is open."
msgstr "Istraži drevno mesto dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear a monster lair"
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu čudovišta"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "An army clears a lair of the North while this stage is open."
msgstr "Vojska očisti jazbinu Severa dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Weather a wave unscathed"
msgstr "Preživi talas bez gubitka"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A wave ends without the Holy City losing Sanctity since this stage began."
msgstr "Talas se završi a da Sveti grad ne izgubi svetost od početka ove faze."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Hold a strong point"
msgstr "Zadrži uporište"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Win a field battle at a choke point or from a fort while this stage is open."
msgstr "Dobij bitku u polju na tesnacu ili iz utvrde dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "With the arch raised, the volkhvs begin the rite that will join the bridge to Prav. Every horde in Nav feels it. Tonight they all come at once, from every front, to break the city before the last words are spoken."
msgstr "Kad je luk podignut, volhvi počinju obred koji će spojiti most sa Pravi. Svaka horda u Navi to oseća. Večeras sve dolaze odjednom, sa svih strana, da slome grad pre nego što se izgovore poslednje reči."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Kalinov Bridge holds"
msgstr "Kalinov most stoji"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The last horde broke against the walls and the rite was finished. The Kalinov Bridge runs from Nav through Yav to Prav, the gods' light holds it end to end, the road from Nav is shut, and the bells of the Holy City ring for the first time in a generation. The old faith lives on, because you held."
msgstr "Poslednja horda se razbila o zidine i obred je završen. Kalinov most vodi iz Navi kroz Jav do Pravi, svetlost bogova drži ga s kraja na kraj, put iz Navi je zatvoren, a zvona Svetog grada zvone prvi put posle jednog pokolenja. Stara vera živi, jer ste vi izdržali."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Holy City has fallen"
msgstr "Sveti grad je pao"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The walls are breached and the sanctuary fires are out. The hordes pour over the Kalinov Bridge unopposed. Some of the people escaped into the forests, carrying the songs with them; perhaps one day they will try again."
msgstr "Zidine su probijene, a vatre u svetilištu ugašene. Horde se bez otpora sjuruju preko Kalinovog mosta. Deo naroda pobegao je u šume, noseći pesme sa sobom; možda će jednog dana pokušati ponovo."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Builders' Barrow"
msgstr "Graditeljska humka"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Smith-Breakers"
msgstr "Kovačolomci"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Elder's Hall"
msgstr "Starešinska kuća"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The heart of the village. Each level opens another building slot and builds a little faster; every few levels add a place in the build queue and another outpost."
msgstr "Srce sela. Svaki nivo otvara još jedno mesto za gradnju i gradi malo brže; svakih nekoliko nivoa dodaje mesto u redu gradnje i još jednu ispostavu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Woodcutter"
msgstr "Drvoseča"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Cuts wood in the forest around the village."
msgstr "Seče drvo u šumi oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Quarry"
msgstr "Kamenolom"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Breaks stone from the hills around the village."
msgstr "Lomi kamen u brdima oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Farm"
msgstr "Njiva"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grows grain, which feeds the village and its troops."
msgstr "Gaji žito, koje hrani selo i njegove trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Iron Mine"
msgstr "Rudnik gvožđa"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Digs iron for weapons, armour and walls."
msgstr "Kopa gvožđe za oružje, oklope i zidine."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Storehouse"
msgstr "Skladište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "How much of each resource the village can keep; what comes in above it is lost. A village may build more than one."
msgstr "Koliko svakog resursa selo može da čuva; ono što stigne preko toga propada. Selo može da izgradi više od jednog."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Barracks"
msgstr "Kasarna"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains infantry. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger troops."
msgstr "Obučava pešadiju. Svaki nivo je obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stables"
msgstr "Konjušnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Breeds horses and trains riders. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger riders."
msgstr "Odgaja konje i obučava jahače. Svaki nivo ih obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače jahače."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Shooting Range"
msgstr "Strelište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains archers, skirmishers and throwers. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger shooters."
msgstr "Obučava strelce, kopljobacače i bacače. Svaki nivo ih obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače strelce."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Hero's Hall"
msgstr "Dvorana junaka"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Recruits generals, who lead armies and command garrisons. Each level lets the hero recover from wounds faster here, and every few levels allow another general."
msgstr "Unajmljuje generale, koji predvode vojske i zapovedaju posadama. Svaki nivo ovde brže leči junaka od rana, a svakih nekoliko nivoa dozvoljava još jednog generala."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Scout Lodge"
msgstr "Izviđačnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains scouts, who ride out to see a horde before it arrives."
msgstr "Obučava izviđače, koji jašu da vide hordu pre nego što stigne."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Caravan Yard"
msgstr "Karavansko dvorište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Keeps caravans to carry resources to allies and to the Holy City vault; each level adds more."
msgstr "Drži karavane koji nose resurse saveznicima i u riznicu Svetog grada; svaki nivo dodaje još."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Settlers' Lodge"
msgstr "Dom doseljenika"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains settlers, who walk out to found new villages."
msgstr "Obučava naseljenike, koji idu da osnuju nova sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Shrine"
msgstr "Svetilište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A shrine to one of the old gods, raised with a Svarog's Ember. Choose its god: the blessing reaches all your villages and grows with every level (turning to another god takes an Ember). Each level takes another Ember and mostly grain, the offering."
msgstr "Svetilište jednom od starih bogova, podignuto Svarogovim žarom. Izaberi boga: blagoslov stiže do svih tvojih sela i raste sa svakim nivoom (okretanje drugom bogu traži jedan žar). Svaki nivo traži još jedan žar i uglavnom žito, kao žrtvu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Perun"
msgstr "Perun"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The thunderer, god of war: your troops strike harder."
msgstr "Gromovnik, bog rata: tvoje trupe udaraju jače."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Svetovid"
msgstr "Svetovid"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The four-faced watcher: your villages hold better."
msgstr "Četvorolični stražar: tvoja sela se bolje drže."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Veles"
msgstr "Veles"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Lord of herds: more grain, and troops eat less."
msgstr "Gospodar stada: više žita, a trupe jedu manje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mokosh"
msgstr "Mokoš"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The mother who spins fate: fuller stores, and raiders carry off less."
msgstr "Majka koja prede sudbinu: punija skladišta, a pljačkaši odnose manje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Svarog"
msgstr "Svarog"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The heavenly smith: you build and train faster."
msgstr "Nebeski kovač: brže gradiš i obučavaš."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Dazhbog"
msgstr "Dažbog"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The giving sun: every resource flows a little richer."
msgstr "Darežljivo sunce: svakog resursa ima malo više."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stribog"
msgstr "Stribog"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grandfather of the winds: caravans and scouts travel faster, and more scouts come home."
msgstr "Deda vetrova: karavani i izviđači putuju brže, a više izviđača se vraća."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Studies the techs of the research tree and brings in the research every tech costs; what you learn helps all your villages."
msgstr "Proučava tehnologije sa stabla istraživanja i donosi istraživanje koje svaka tehnologija košta; ono što naučiš pomaže svim tvojim selima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Outpost"
msgstr "Ispostava"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A camp on a nearby hex that gathers what the land gives: wood in forests, stone and iron in hills and mountains, grain on plains and lakes."
msgstr "Logor na obližnjem polju koji skuplja ono što zemlja daje: drvo u šumama, kamen i gvožđe u brdima i planinama, žito na ravnicama i jezerima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Farmstead"
msgstr "Salaš"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Fields and a barn on the open plain: grain."
msgstr "Njive i ambar na otvorenoj ravnici: žito."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sawmill"
msgstr "Pilana"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A saw pit and log piles in the woods: wood."
msgstr "Jama za testeru i gomile trupaca u šumi: drvo."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stone cut from the hillside, and the iron in it."
msgstr "Kamen isečen iz padine brda, i gvožđe u njemu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Woodland camp"
msgstr "Šumski logor"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Loggers and stonecutters on the wooded hills: a little of everything."
msgstr "Drvoseče i kamenoresci na šumovitim brdima: pomalo od svega."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mine"
msgstr "Rudnik"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A shaft into the mountain: stone and iron."
msgstr "Okno u planinu: kamen i gvožđe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Fishing boat"
msgstr "Ribarski čamac"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Nets cast from a boat on the lake: fish for the granary."
msgstr "Mreže bačene sa čamca na jezeru: riba za žitnicu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Granary-Temple"
msgstr "Žitnica-hram"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The stag-folk's own: a temple granary that brings in grain and feeds the troops for less."
msgstr "Samo jelenov rod: hramska žitnica koja donosi žito i jeftinije hrani trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stone Redoubt"
msgstr "Kameno utvrđenje"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The bear-folk's own: a stone keep that makes the garrison harder to break."
msgstr "Samo medvedov rod: kamena kula zbog koje je posadu teže slomiti."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Longhouse Hall"
msgstr "Dugačka dvorana"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The wolf-folk's own: a longhouse where warriors eat less and train faster."
msgstr "Samo vučji rod: duga kuća u kojoj ratnici jedu manje i brže se obučavaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Walls"
msgstr "Bedemi"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The walls round the village: hordes must break or climb them before they reach the garrison. Higher levels change wood for stone."
msgstr "Zidine oko sela: horde moraju da ih probiju ili preskoče pre nego što dođu do posade. Viši nivoi menjaju drvo kamenom."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Archer Tower"
msgstr "Strelačka kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A tower on the walls: its archers make the garrison strike harder while the walls stand."
msgstr "Kula na zidinama: njeni strelci čine da posada jače udara dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Gate Tower"
msgstr "Kapija-kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Strengthens the gate, so the walls take longer to batter down."
msgstr "Ojačava kapiju, pa se zidine duže probijaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Ballista Platform"
msgstr "Postolje za balistu"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A great crossbow on the walls that smashes the horde's siege engines."
msgstr "Veliki samostrel na zidinama koji razbija opsadne sprave horde."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Murder Holes"
msgstr "Puškarnice"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Openings over the gate to rain stones on the attackers: the garrison defends better while the walls stand."
msgstr "Otvori iznad kapije za bacanje kamenja na napadače: posada se bolje brani dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Moat"
msgstr "Opkop"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A moat before the walls: it keeps off battering and climbers and slows the building of siege engines; at higher levels it holds water."
msgstr "Jarak pred zidinama: odbija udarce i penjače i usporava gradnju opsadnih sprava; na višim nivoima drži vodu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Watchtower"
msgstr "Osmatračnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sees hordes coming from farther away, so the warning comes sooner."
msgstr "Vidi horde izdaleka, pa upozorenje stiže ranije."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Forester"
msgstr "Šumar"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Tends the woods so they grow back thick: 5% more wood per level, from fields and outposts alike. Needs a Woodcutter of level 5."
msgstr "Neguje šume da ponovo izrastu guste: 5% više drveta po nivou, i sa polja i sa ispostava. Potrebna je Drvoseča nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stonemason"
msgstr "Kamenorezac"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Dresses the stone as it comes in: 5% more stone per level. Needs a Quarry of level 5."
msgstr "Obrađuje kamen čim stigne: 5% više kamena po nivou. Potreban je Kamenolom nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mill"
msgstr "Vodenica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grinds the grain so less goes to waste: 5% more grain per level. Needs a Farm of level 5."
msgstr "Melje žito da manje propadne: 5% više žita po nivou. Potrebna je Njiva nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Smelter"
msgstr "Topionica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Smelts the ore hotter: 5% more iron per level. Needs an Iron Mine of level 5."
msgstr "Topi rudu na jačoj vatri: 5% više gvožđa po nivou. Potreban je Rudnik gvožđa nivoa 5."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Hospital"
msgstr "Bolnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Tends the wounded: when the garrison holds its own village, 5% per level of its fallen get up again."
msgstr "Leči ranjene: kad posada odbrani svoje selo, 5% njenih palih po nivou ponovo ustaje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Masons' Guild"
msgstr "Zidarski esnaf"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Master builders who teach the village's hands the craft: every building goes up 2% faster per level."
msgstr "Majstori graditelji koji uče seoske ruke zanatu: svaka zgrada se gradi 2% brže po nivou."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Workers' Huts"
msgstr "Radničke kolibe"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Homes for the hands who work the fields, woods, quarries and mines: 2% more of every resource per level."
msgstr "Domovi za ruke koje rade na poljima, u šumama, kamenolomima i rudnicima: 2% više svakog resursa po nivou."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grain Silo"
msgstr "Silos za žito"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A tall store for grain alone: the village keeps more grain, for its people, its garrison and the armies it feeds. A village may build more than one."
msgstr "Visoko skladište samo za žito: selo čuva više žita, za svoje ljude, posadu i vojske koje hrani. Selo može izgraditi više od jednog."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Fisherman's Hut"
msgstr "Ribarska koliba"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Nets and weirs on the water beside the village bring in fish: grain every hour, more each level. Only for a village beside a lake or on a river."
msgstr "Mreže i vrše na vodi pored sela donose ribu: žito svakog sata, više sa svakim nivoom. Samo za selo pored jezera ili na reci."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Water Wheel"
msgstr "Vodenica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The river turns the wheel and the wheel turns the work: 3% more of every resource and 3% faster building per level. Only for a village beside a lake or on a river."
msgstr "Reka okreće točak, a točak okreće posao: 3% više svakog resursa i 3% brža gradnja po nivou. Samo za selo pored jezera ili na reci."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Windmill"
msgstr "Vetrenjača"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sails on the hilltop grind the grain finer: 6% more grain per level. Only for a village on hills."
msgstr "Krila na vrhu brda melju žito sitnije: 6% više žita po nivou. Samo za selo na brdima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Ranch"
msgstr "Ranč"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Herds graze the open plains: grain every hour, more each level, and the village's riders come from better horses, 2% stronger per level (10% at the top). Only for a village on the plains."
msgstr "Krda pasu na otvorenoj ravnici: žito svakog sata, više sa svakim nivoom, a konjanici sela jašu bolje konje, 2% jači po nivou (10% na vrhu). Samo za selo na ravnici."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Mountain Lodge"
msgstr "Planinska koliba"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Miners, quarrymen and woodcutters who know the mountain's slopes: 5% more wood, stone and iron per level. Only for a village next to a mountain."
msgstr "Rudari, kamenoresci i drvoseče koji poznaju planinske padine: 5% više drveta, kamena i gvožđa po nivou. Samo za selo pored planine."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Kovačnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Forges better arms, armor and harness for one kind of unit at a time: sharper attack, stouter defense, tougher troops, a faster march. What you forge serves all your villages. Each level forges 3% faster and higher levels forge the finer work."
msgstr "Kuje bolje oružje, oklope i opremu za jednu vrstu jedinica odjednom: oštriji napad, čvršću odbranu, izdržljivije trupe, brži marš. Što iskuješ služi svim tvojim selima. Svaki nivo kuje 3% brže, a viši nivoi kuju finiji rad."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Market"
msgstr "Pijaca"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trades one resource for another, at better rates every level, and buys the hero's spare gear."
msgstr "Menja jedan resurs za drugi, po boljem kursu sa svakim nivoom, i otkupljuje junakovu suvišnu opremu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Jelena"
msgstr "Rod Jelena"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stag"
msgstr "Jelen"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The stag-folk of the river meadows: first to sow, first to harvest, their villages grow like spring grass. They were never riders."
msgstr "Jelenov rod sa rečnih livada: prvi seju, prvi žanju, a sela im rastu kao prolećna trava. Konjanici nikad nisu bili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Nizhny Novgorod (1781): a red stag walking, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Nižnjeg Novgoroda (1781): crveni jelen u hodu, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Grain and fast village growth"
msgstr "Žito i brz rast sela"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weak cavalry"
msgstr "Slaba konjica"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Rysa"
msgstr "Rod Risa"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Lynx"
msgstr "Ris"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The lynx-folk of the deep woods strike from the shadows of the trees and are gone before the horde can turn. Their elders trust old ways over new learning."
msgstr "Risov rod iz dubokih šuma udara iz senke drveća i nestaje pre nego što se horda okrene. Njihove starešine više veruju starim običajima nego novom znanju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Gomel (granted in 1781): a gold lynx lying, on blue."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Gomelja (dodeljen 1781): zlatni ris koji leži, na plavom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Wood and ambushes"
msgstr "Drvo i zasede"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower research"
msgstr "Sporije istraživanje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Medvěda"
msgstr "Rod Medveda"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Bear"
msgstr "Medved"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The bear-folk of the iron hills dig deep and build thick walls. They are slow to leave the den they have made."
msgstr "Medvedov rod sa gvozdenih brda kopa duboko i zida debele zidove. Teško napuštaju brlog koji su sagradili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Yaroslavl (1672): a black bear upright with a gold poleaxe, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Jaroslavlja (1672): crni medved uspravljen sa zlatnom sekirom, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Iron and fortifications"
msgstr "Gvožđe i utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower expansion"
msgstr "Sporije širenje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Bobra"
msgstr "Rod Dabra"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Beaver"
msgstr "Dabar"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The beaver-folk know every river and ford; their barges carry what the roads cannot. Their homes are built for trade, not for siege."
msgstr "Dabrov rod zna svaku reku i svaki gaz; njihove barke nose ono što putevi ne mogu. Domovi su im građeni za trgovinu, ne za opsadu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Bobrov (1781): a beaver in its own colour, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Bobrova (1781): dabar u svojoj boji, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Caravan speed and capacity"
msgstr "Brzina i kapacitet karavana"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker fortifications"
msgstr "Slabija utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Sokola"
msgstr "Rod Sokola"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Falcon"
msgstr "Sokol"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The falcon-folk of the open steppe ride fast and see far; their scouts come home when others do not. They have little patience for stonework."
msgstr "Sokolov rod sa otvorene stepe jaše brzo i vidi daleko; njihovi izviđači se vraćaju kad drugi ne mogu. Nemaju strpljenja za kamen."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Sokołów Podlaski (seal of 1764): a falcon on an oak branch with a gold ring in its beak, on gold."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Sokolova Podlaskog (pečat iz 1764): soko na hrastovoj grani sa zlatnim prstenom u kljunu, na zlatnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Cavalry and scouts (fewer scout losses)"
msgstr "Konjica i izviđači (manji gubici izviđača)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Costlier forts"
msgstr "Skuplje utvrde"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Volka"
msgstr "Rod Vuka"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Wolf"
msgstr "Vuk"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The wolf-folk of the northern stone fields know the cold and the things that come out of it. Their thin soil feeds them poorly."
msgstr "Vučji rod sa severnih kamenih polja poznaje hladnoću i ono što iz nje dolazi. Tanka zemlja ih slabo hrani."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Vovchansk (1781): a silver wolf running over green ground, on blue."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Vovčanska (1781): srebrni vuk u trku preko zelene zemlje, na plavom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stone and cold resistance (against the North)"
msgstr "Kamen i otpornost na hladnoću (protiv Severa)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker grain"
msgstr "Slabije žito"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Tura"
msgstr "Rod Tura"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Aurochs"
msgstr "Tur"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The aurochs-folk of the river meadows stand like their wild cattle: shoulder to shoulder, horns forward, never giving ground. Their heavy wagons crawl."
msgstr "Turov narod sa rečnih livada stoji kao njihova divlja goveda: rame uz rame, rogovima napred, nikad ne uzmičući. Njihova teška kola puze."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A black aurochs' head, on gold."
msgstr "Crna glava tura, na zlatu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Home defense and infantry"
msgstr "Odbrana doma i pešadija"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower caravans"
msgstr "Sporiji karavani"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Gavrana"
msgstr "Rod Gavrana"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Raven"
msgstr "Gavran"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The raven-folk keep the old knowledge and send their birds where men cannot go. Their fields are thin; their elders read the sky instead."
msgstr "Gavranov narod čuva staro znanje i šalje svoje ptice kuda ljudi ne mogu. Njive su im mršave; njihovi starci umesto toga čitaju nebo."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A black raven standing, on silver."
msgstr "Crni gavran koji stoji, na srebru."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Research and scouts (fewer scout losses)"
msgstr "Istraživanje i izvidnici (manje izgubljenih izvidnika)"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Less grain"
msgstr "Manje žita"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Lisice"
msgstr "Rod Lisice"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Fox"
msgstr "Lisica"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The fox-folk trade where others fight and hide what others lose. Their palisades are an afterthought: they would rather not be found."
msgstr "Lisičji narod trguje gde se drugi bore i krije ono što drugi gube. Palisade su im usputna misao: radije bi da ih niko ne nađe."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A red fox leaping, on green."
msgstr "Crvena lisica u skoku, na zelenom."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Market trades, and less lost to plundering hordes"
msgstr "Trgovina na pijaci, i manje izgubljeno od horde koja pljačka"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker home defense"
msgstr "Slabija odbrana doma"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Zmije"
msgstr "Rod Zmije"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Serpent"
msgstr "Zmija"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The serpent-folk live among the old stones and know where the ancients hid their treasures. Their many mouths are hard to feed."
msgstr "Zmijin narod živi među starim kamenjem i zna gde su drevni sakrili svoja blaga. Mnoga njihova usta teško je nahraniti."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "A gold serpent coiled, on blue."
msgstr "Zlatna sklupčana zmija, na plavom."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stone, iron and richer finds in ancient sites"
msgstr "Kamen, gvožđe i bogatiji nalazi na drevnim mestima"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Costlier upkeep"
msgstr "Skuplje izdržavanje"

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "A border lord's charge: hordes come in their usual numbers and give you five quiet raids to dig in."
msgstr "Dužnost graničnog gospodara: horde dolaze u uobičajenom broju i daju vam pet mirnih pohoda da se ukopate."

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "Bigger hordes that keep pace with your strength, more camps, and only three raids before they come to burn."
msgstr "Veće horde koje prate vašu snagu, više logora, i samo tri pohoda pre nego što krenu da pale."

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "Hordes half again as large, camps everywhere, and no grace: the first horde may already burn a village."
msgstr "Horde upola veće, logori svuda, i bez milosti: već prva horda može spaliti selo."

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "A march on the edge of Nav: huge hordes that grow as fast as you do, and burn rather than plunder."
msgstr "Krajina na ivici Navi: ogromne horde koje rastu brzo kao i vi, i radije pale nego pljačkaju."

#: data/difficulty.json
msgid "The whole of Nav against your duchy: the largest hordes, the most camps, and no mercy at all."
msgstr "Cela Nav protiv vašeg vojvodstva: najveće horde, najviše logora, i nimalo milosti."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Monsters of the North"
msgstr "Čudovišta Severa"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Beasts and creatures of the old forests. Erratic and savage; they fight on past reason."
msgstr "Zveri i stvorenja starih šuma. Nepredvidive i divlje; bore se i kad više nema smisla."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Avatar of Černobog"
msgstr "Avatar Černoboga"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Leshy's Thrall"
msgstr "Lešijev rob"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Rusalka"
msgstr "Rusalka"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Grey Wolf"
msgstr "Sivi vuk"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Cave Bear"
msgstr "Pećinski medved"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Upyr"
msgstr "Upir"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Volkolak"
msgstr "Vukodlak"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Likho"
msgstr "Liho"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Storm Vila"
msgstr "Vila oluje"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Black Boar"
msgstr "Crni vepar"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Div"
msgstr "Div"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Firebird"
msgstr "Žar-ptica"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Zmey Whelp"
msgstr "Zmajče"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Nomad Horde"
msgstr "Nomadska horda"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fast horse archers out of the steppe. They raid rather than stay, burn outposts far from their road and carry off more."
msgstr "Brzi konjički strelci iz stepe. Radije pljačkaju nego da ostanu, pale ispostave daleko od svog puta i odnose više."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Levy"
msgstr "Stepski ustanik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Horse Archer"
msgstr "Konjički strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Raider"
msgstr "Stepski pljačkaš"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Shaman"
msgstr "Stepski šaman"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Kipchak Bowman"
msgstr "Kipčački strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Lancer"
msgstr "Kopljonoša"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Kurgan Guard"
msgstr "Kurganska straža"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fire Archer"
msgstr "Ognjeni strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Khan's Guard"
msgstr "Kanova straža"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Bagatur"
msgstr "Bagatur"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Khan's Marksman"
msgstr "Kanov strelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Steppe Cataphract"
msgstr "Stepski katafrakt"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Scaling Ladder"
msgstr "Opsadne lestve"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Order of the One Throne"
msgstr "Red Jedinog prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Disciplined zealots in heavy ranks with crossbows. Slow, and they do not break easily."
msgstr "Disciplinovani zelote u teškim redovima, sa samostrelima. Spori, i ne lome se lako."

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Zealot"
msgstr "Zelot"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Crossbowman"
msgstr "Samostrelac"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Mounted Sergeant"
msgstr "Konjički narednik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Inquisitor"
msgstr "Inkvizitor"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Arbalester"
msgstr "Arbalestar"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Knight-Brother"
msgstr "Vitez-brat"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Templar of the Throne"
msgstr "Templar prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Pavise Crossbowman"
msgstr "Samostrelac sa pavezom"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Grand Knight"
msgstr "Veliki vitez"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Champion of the Throne"
msgstr "Šampion prestola"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Fire Priest"
msgstr "Ognjeni sveštenik"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Lord Marshal"
msgstr "Lord maršal"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Siege Ram"
msgstr "Opsadni ovan"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Catapult"
msgstr "Katapult"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "Siege Tower"
msgstr "Opsadna kula"

#: data/enemies.json
msgid "The Order's western host: knights and crossbows. Slow, and they do not break easily."
msgstr "Zapadna vojska Reda: vitezovi i samostreli. Spori, i ne lome se lako."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Clear the forest"
msgstr "Iskrči šumu"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Fell the trees for the land beneath: forest becomes plains, wooded hills bare hills, and the timber comes home."
msgstr "Poseci drveće zbog zemlje ispod: šuma postaje ravnica, šumovita brda gola brda, a drvo stiže kući."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Plant trees"
msgstr "Posadi drveće"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Sow a wood: plains become forest, hills wooded hills, for woodcutters and outposts to come. Nothing comes home."
msgstr "Zasadi šumu: ravnica postaje šuma, brda šumovita brda, za drvoseče i ispostave koje dolaze. Ništa ne stiže kući."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Drain the swamp"
msgstr "Isuši močvaru"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Dig ditches until the swamp is dry plains. Nothing comes home."
msgstr "Kopaj kanale dok močvara ne postane suva ravnica. Ništa ne stiže kući."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Level the hills"
msgstr "Poravnaj brda"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Cut the hills down to plains; the stone comes home."
msgstr "Iseci brda do ravnice; kamen stiže kući."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Burn the forest"
msgstr "Spali šumu"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Set the forest alight: nothing gets through while it burns, and the fire may spread to the trees around it, burning what stands there. Forest becomes plains, wooded hills bare hills; the timber is lost."
msgstr "Zapali šumu: ništa ne prolazi dok gori, a vatra se može proširiti na drveće oko nje i spaliti ono što tamo stoji. Šuma postaje ravnica, šumovita brda gola brda; drvo je izgubljeno."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Make a lake"
msgstr "Napravi jezero"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Dam the streams until the plains or the swamp lie under water: a lake for fishermen and boats, and a wall no army crosses."
msgstr "Pregradi potoke dok ravnica ili močvara ne potonu pod vodu: jezero za ribare i čamce, i zid koji nijedna vojska ne prelazi."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Make a wetland"
msgstr "Napravi močvaru"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Turn the streams onto the plains until they are swamp: slow, treacherous ground for any horde."
msgstr "Skreni potoke na ravnicu dok ne postane močvara: spor, varljiv teren za svaku hordu."

#: data/field.json
msgid "Extend a river"
msgstr "Produži reku"

#: data/field.json
msgid "Dig the river on along this hex's edge, toward the hex you choose: nothing crosses it without a bridge."
msgstr "Prokopaj reku dalje duž ivice ovog polja, prema polju koje izabereš: niko je ne prelazi bez mosta."

#: data/forts.json
msgid "The fort's heart. Each level widens the land the fort's village can reshape and build roads on; levels 4 and 7 open the middle and the outer wall."
msgstr "Srce utvrde. Svaki nivo širi zemlju koju selo utvrde može da preoblikuje i na kojoj gradi puteve; nivoi 4 i 7 otvaraju srednji i spoljni zid."

#: data/forts.json
msgid "Quarters for the fort's own defenders: a few spearmen, archers and horsemen for every level, who never leave the fort. The fallen are replaced, one at a time."
msgstr "Odaje za branioce utvrde: nekoliko kopljanika, strelaca i konjanika za svaki nivo, koji nikad ne napuštaju utvrdu. Pali se zamenjuju, jedan po jedan."

#: data/forts.json
msgid "The fort's grain store: for the armies holding it and for its own upkeep."
msgstr "Žitnica utvrde: za vojske koje je drže i za njeno izdržavanje."

#: data/forts.json
msgid "Inner wall"
msgstr "Unutrašnji zid"

#: data/forts.json
msgid "Middle wall"
msgstr "Srednji zid"

#: data/forts.json
msgid "Outer wall"
msgstr "Spoljni zid"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Horseman"
msgstr "Konjanik"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Rides round the enemy's wing; slow to close a ring."
msgstr "Obilazi neprijateljevo krilo; spor da zatvori obruč."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Hammer and anvil"
msgstr "Čekić i nakovanj"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Closes a pincer hard; careless of a breakthrough."
msgstr "Snažno steže klešta; ne mari za proboj."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Netmaker"
msgstr "Pletilja mreža"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Surrounds the enemy like a net; his flanks are thin."
msgstr "Okružuje neprijatelja kao mreža; bokovi su mu tanki."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Steadfast"
msgstr "Postojani"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Holds and strikes back when the enemy overreaches; no hand for pincers."
msgstr "Drži liniju i uzvraća kad se neprijatelj previše istegne; nije vešt s kleštima."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Old wolf"
msgstr "Stari vuk"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Knows every flank and pincer, and wins none of them by much."
msgstr "Zna svaki obuhvat i klešta, a nijednim ne dobija mnogo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Shield wall"
msgstr "Zid od štitova"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Breaks through when beset; never spreads his men to surround a foe."
msgstr "Probija kad je opkoljen; nikad ne razvlači ljude da okruži neprijatelja."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Battle Fury"
msgstr "Bojni bes"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+4% attack for every troop per rank."
msgstr "+4% napada za svu vojsku po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Spearhead"
msgstr "Vrh koplja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+6% infantry attack per rank."
msgstr "+6% napada pešadije po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Horse Lord"
msgstr "Gospodar konja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+6% cavalry attack per rank."
msgstr "+6% napada konjice po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Shield Bearer"
msgstr "Štitonoša"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+4% defense for every troop per rank."
msgstr "+4% odbrane za svu vojsku po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Hold Fast"
msgstr "Čvrst stav"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "+5% for defenders at home per rank."
msgstr "+5% za branioce kod kuće po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Iron Will"
msgstr "Gvozdena volja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Raiders take 8% less per rank."
msgstr "Pljačkaši odnose 8% manje po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Pathfinder"
msgstr "Tragač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Scouts from the hero's village travel 10% faster per rank."
msgstr "Izviđači iz junakovog sela putuju 10% brže po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Keen Eyes"
msgstr "Oštro oko"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Scouts from the hero's village are 5 points likelier to return per rank."
msgstr "Izviđači iz junakovog sela se vraćaju sa 5 poena većom verovatnoćom po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Quartermaster"
msgstr "Intendant"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Caravans from the hero's village carry 10% more per rank."
msgstr "Karavani iz junakovog sela nose 10% više po rangu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Axe of Perun"
msgstr "Perunova sekira"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thunder rides its edge."
msgstr "Grom jaše na njenom sečivu."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thunder Banner"
msgstr "Gromovni barjak"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Woven with Perun's sign."
msgstr "Utkan Perunovim znakom."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear-hide Cloak"
msgstr "Ogrtač od medveđe kože"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "From a cave bear of the north."
msgstr "Od pećinskog medveda sa severa."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear-tooth Amulet"
msgstr "Amajlija od medveđeg zuba"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Old as the forest."
msgstr "Stara kao šuma."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ash Spear"
msgstr "Jasenovo koplje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Light and true."
msgstr "Lako i pravo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mail Shirt"
msgstr "Verižnjača"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ring after ring."
msgstr "Karika za karikom."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thread of Mokosh"
msgstr "Mokošina nit"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The spinner hides what is yours."
msgstr "Prelja krije ono što je tvoje."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Wolf Banner"
msgstr "Vučji barjak"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The pack defends its own."
msgstr "Čopor brani svoje."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Steppe Horse"
msgstr "Stepski konj"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Never tires."
msgstr "Nikad se ne umara."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Grey Stallion"
msgstr "Sivi pastuv"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A warhorse of the old princes."
msgstr "Bojni konj starih knezova."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Perun's Thunder"
msgstr "Perunov grom"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Bear Clan"
msgstr "Medveđi klan"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Dobrynya"
msgstr "Dobrinja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The serpent-slayer prince"
msgstr "Knez zmajoubica"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A prince's son who struck down the Zmey at the Puchai river. Bold in the charge, and a retinue to keep fed."
msgstr "Kneževski sin koji je ubio Zmaja na reci Pučaj. Hrabar u jurišu, uz pratnju koju treba hraniti."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Rallying cry"
msgstr "Bojni poklič"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "His name alone makes men fight harder at their own gates."
msgstr "Samo njegovo ime tera ljude da se jače bore pred svojim vratima."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Hammer of the flank"
msgstr "Čekić s boka"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "His riders crash into the enemy's flank; he has little patience for long sieges of men."
msgstr "Njegovi konjanici udaraju u neprijateljev bok; nema strpljenja za duga okruženja."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Vasilisa"
msgstr "Vasilisa"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The forest huntress"
msgstr "Šumska lovkinja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "She reads the forest like a letter. Her bow never misses, but she is no shield-wall fighter."
msgstr "Šumu čita kao pismo. Njen luk ne promašuje, ali nije borac za zid od štitova."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Tracker"
msgstr "Tragač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Moves fast and teaches the scouts to come back alive."
msgstr "Kreće se brzo i uči izviđače da se vrate živi."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Turn of the tide"
msgstr "Preokret"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "She waits for the enemy to overreach, then strikes back hard; she will not close a trap herself."
msgstr "Čeka da se neprijatelj previše istegne, pa snažno uzvraća; sama ne zatvara zamke."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Volkh"
msgstr "Volh"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The wise volkhv"
msgstr "Mudri volhv"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A priest of the old gods who knows herbs, stars and secrets. Wisdom over the sword."
msgstr "Sveštenik starih bogova koji zna trave, zvezde i tajne. Mudrost iznad mača."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Healing rites"
msgstr "Obredi isceljenja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Rises from wounds in half the time, and learns from every fight."
msgstr "Od rana se diže dvostruko brže i uči iz svake bitke."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Wolf pack"
msgstr "Vučji čopor"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He sends his men round the enemy like wolves round a herd, but loathes a simple flank."
msgstr "Šalje ljude oko neprijatelja kao vukove oko stada, ali mrzi običan obuhvat."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Sadko"
msgstr "Sadko"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The merchant rider"
msgstr "Trgovac jahač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A gusli player turned the richest trader of Novgorod. Gold opens more gates than steel."
msgstr "Guslar koji je postao najbogatiji trgovac Novgoroda. Zlato otvara više kapija od čelika."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Silver tongue"
msgstr "Srebrni jezik"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Talks raiders out of a fifth of what they came for."
msgstr "Odgovori pljačkaše od petine onoga po šta su došli."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "River sense"
msgstr "Rečni njuh"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He knows where a flank lies open, but panics when the line breaks."
msgstr "Zna gde je bok otvoren, ali paniči kad linija pukne."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Nastasya"
msgstr "Nastasja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The shieldmaiden"
msgstr "Ratnica sa štitom"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A polyanitsa of the steppe border who has never given ground. Slow to march, impossible to move."
msgstr "Poljanica sa stepske granice koja nikad nije ustuknula. Spora u maršu, nepomerljiva u boju."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Unbreakable"
msgstr "Nesalomiva"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Her spearmen train faster and hold the walls longer."
msgstr "Njeni kopljanici se brže obučavaju i duže drže zidine."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Iron counter"
msgstr "Gvozdeni odgovor"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Her spearmen hold, then break through; she never spreads them thin enough to surround a foe."
msgstr "Njeni kopljanici drže, pa probijaju; nikad ih ne razvuče dovoljno da okruži neprijatelja."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ilya"
msgstr "Ilija"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The old bogatyr"
msgstr "Stari bogatir"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Thirty years he sat by the stove; then he rose stronger than any man. Strong in all things, slow to learn new ones."
msgstr "Trideset godina je sedeo kraj peći, a onda ustao jači od svakog čoveka. Snažan u svemu, spor da nauči nešto novo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Strength of the earth"
msgstr "Snaga zemlje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mother Earth hides him: he is wounded for less time."
msgstr "Majka Zemlja ga čuva: kraće ostaje ranjen."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Two-handed blow"
msgstr "Udarac s obe ruke"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He closes the pincer like a mace swung from both sides; once beaten back, he is slow to recover."
msgstr "Steže klešta kao buzdovan zamahnut s obe strane; kad ga odbiju, sporo se oporavlja."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Alyosha"
msgstr "Aljoša"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The cunning youngest bogatyr"
msgstr "Lukavi najmlađi bogatir"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "A priest's son from Rostov who wins by wit as often as by the sword: he beat Tugarin by a trick no one else would stoop to."
msgstr "Popov sin iz Rostova koji pobeđuje dosetkom jednako često kao mačem: Tugarina je savladao lukavstvom na koje se niko drugi ne bi spustio."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Sharp wit"
msgstr "Oštar um"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "His scouts ride faster, and raiders carry off less of what he guards."
msgstr "Njegovi izvidnici jašu brže, a pljačkaši odnose manje od onoga što on čuva."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Trickster's trap"
msgstr "Lukavčeva zamka"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He lures the enemy between his wings, but his men scatter when told to surround."
msgstr "Mami neprijatelja među svoja krila, ali mu se ljudi rasprše kad treba da okruže."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mikula"
msgstr "Mikula"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The giant ploughman"
msgstr "Div orač"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The ploughman whose plough no prince's retinue could lift from the furrow. The earth loves him; war comes slowly to him."
msgstr "Orač čiji plug nijedna kneževa družina nije mogla da izvuče iz brazde. Zemlja ga voli; rat mu dolazi sporo."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Mother earth's son"
msgstr "Sin majke zemlje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Full barns: every village stores a tenth more."
msgstr "Pune ambare: svako selo čuva desetinu više."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The furrow closes"
msgstr "Brazda se zatvara"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He ploughs round the enemy as round a field, but his farmers make clumsy pincers."
msgstr "Ore oko neprijatelja kao oko njive, ali njegovi seljaci prave nespretna klešta."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Marya"
msgstr "Marja"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The warrior queen"
msgstr "Kraljica ratnica"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Marya Morevna, who chained Koschei and rode to war while her husband kept house. Her riders and her captains fear no one; books can wait."
msgstr "Marja Morevna, koja je okovala Koščeja i jahala u rat dok joj je muž čuvao kuću. Njeni konjanici i vojvode ne boje se nikoga; knjige mogu da čekaju."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Queen of the steppe"
msgstr "Kraljica stepe"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "She rides ahead of her own armies."
msgstr "Jaše ispred svojih vojski."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Steppe horns"
msgstr "Stepski rogovi"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Her horsemen sweep both flanks of the foe; she gives no thought to being broken through."
msgstr "Njeni konjanici pometu oba neprijateljeva boka; ne misli na to da je mogu probiti."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Svyatogor"
msgstr "Svjatogor"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The mountain giant"
msgstr "Div sa planine"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "So huge that only the mountains can bear him. In battle he is a host on his own, on the road a slow one, at table a ruinous guest."
msgstr "Toliko golem da ga samo planine mogu nositi. U bici je sam čitava vojska, na putu spora, a za stolom gost koji upropasti domaćina."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "The earth groans"
msgstr "Zemlja stenje"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Hordes falter before the gates he stands behind."
msgstr "Horde posrću pred kapijama iza kojih on stoji."

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "Ring of mountains"
msgstr "Prsten planina"

#: data/heroes.json
msgid "He walls the enemy in on every side; his bulk is wasted on a flank."
msgstr "Zazida neprijatelja sa svih strana; njegova snaga je uzaludna na boku."

#: data/horde.json
msgid "{owner}'s refuge"
msgstr "Utočište igrača {owner}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Savagery"
msgstr "Divljaštvo"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "+4% attack for the horde per rank."
msgstr "+4% napada za hordu po rangu."

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Thick Hide"
msgstr "Debela koža"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "+4% defense for the horde per rank."
msgstr "+4% odbrane za hordu po rangu."

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Dread"
msgstr "Strava"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "The horde holds 6% longer before it breaks, per rank."
msgstr "Horda izdrži 6% duže pre nego što se slomi, po rangu."

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Greed"
msgstr "Pohlepa"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "+12% carried off from a raid per rank."
msgstr "+12% plena iz pljačke po rangu."

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "{name} the Hungry"
msgstr "{name} Gladni"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "{name} the Dread"
msgstr "{name} Strašni"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "{name} the Deathless"
msgstr "{name} Besmrtni"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Beg {name}"
msgstr "Beg {name}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Khan {name}"
msgstr "Kan {name}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Great Khan {name}"
msgstr "Veliki kan {name}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Brother {name}"
msgstr "Brat {name}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Commander {name}"
msgstr "Komtur {name}"

#: data/leaders.json
msgid "Grand Master {name}"
msgstr "Veliki majstor {name}"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Song of the Sowers"
msgstr "Pesma sejača"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Every field yields 5% more grain."
msgstr "Svaka njiva daje 5% više žita."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Ledger of Veles"
msgstr "Velesova knjiga"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Caravans carry 15% more."
msgstr "Karavani nose 15% više."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Oath of Perun"
msgstr "Perunova zakletva"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "All troops strike 5% harder."
msgstr "Sva vojska udara 5% jače."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Weave of Mokosh"
msgstr "Mokošino tkanje"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Storehouses hold 10% more."
msgstr "Skladišta primaju 10% više."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Hymn of Dazhbog"
msgstr "Dažbogova himna"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "All troops hold 5% better."
msgstr "Sva vojska drži 5% bolje."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Winds of Stribog"
msgstr "Stribogovi vetrovi"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Teaches the Wind Riders' craft (a rare tech)."
msgstr "Uči veštinu Jahača vetra (retko znanje)."

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Rite of Svarog's Forge"
msgstr "Obred Svarogove kovačnice"

#: data/lore.json
msgid "Teaches forging with Svarog's Ember (a rare tech)."
msgstr "Uči kovanje Svarogovim žarom (retko znanje)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Raise a building"
msgstr "Podigni građevinu"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Open your village and queue any building or field upgrade."
msgstr "Otvori svoje selo i stavi u red bilo koju gradnju ili unapređenje polja."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "The elder looks at the thin palisade and the half-empty fields. \"Walls and bread first, child. Everything else grows from them.\""
msgstr "Starešina gleda tanku palisadu i polupuna polja. „Prvo zidovi i hleb, dete. Sve ostalo raste iz njih.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap Village on the bottom bar."
msgstr "Dodirni Selo na donjoj traci."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap an empty plot or a building in the village."
msgstr "Dodirni prazno mesto ili zgradu u selu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap Build or Upgrade in the sheet."
msgstr "Dodirni Gradi ili Unapredi na listu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Train defenders"
msgstr "Obuči branioce"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Build a Barracks and train any unit there."
msgstr "Sagradi kasarnu i obuči bilo koju jedinicu u njoj."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"The hordes do not wait for the harvest. Put spears in the hands of those who can hold them.\""
msgstr "„Horde ne čekaju žetvu. Daj koplja u ruke onima koji mogu da ih drže.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Build a Barracks on a free plot in the village (no free plot? Upgrade the Elder's Hall: each level opens one)."
msgstr "Izgradi Kasarnu na slobodnom mestu u selu (nema slobodnog mesta? Unapredi Dom starešina: svaki nivo otvara jedno)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "When it stands, open the Troops tab."
msgstr "Kad bude gotova, otvori karticu Trupe."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Pick a unit and a number, then tap Train."
msgstr "Izaberi jedinicu i broj, pa dodirni Obuka."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Claim an outpost"
msgstr "Zauzmi ispostavu"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap a forest, hill, field or mine hex near your village and claim it."
msgstr "Dodirni polje šume, brda, njive ili rudnika blizu svog sela i zauzmi ga."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"The land around us is rich, and nobody tends it. Set a camp there before the beasts do.\""
msgstr "„Zemlja oko nas je bogata, a niko je ne obrađuje. Podigni tamo logor pre zveri.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Go back to the map."
msgstr "Vrati se na mapu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap a forest, hills, plains, mountain or lake hex next to your village."
msgstr "Dodirni polje šume, brda, ravnice, planine ili jezera pored svog sela."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "In the sheet, tap Claim beside Build an outpost."
msgstr "Na listu dodirni Prisvoji pored Gradi ispostavu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Build a Scout Lodge and send scouts at a horde, a camp or an ancient site."
msgstr "Sagradi izviđačnicu i pošalji izviđače na hordu, logor ili drevno mesto."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"Fear is what you feel about a thing you have not seen. Go and see it.\""
msgstr "„Strah je ono što osećaš prema nečemu što nisi video. Idi i pogledaj.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Build a Scout Lodge on a free plot in the village (no free plot? Upgrade the Elder's Hall)."
msgstr "Izgradi Izviđačnicu na slobodnom mestu u selu (nema slobodnog mesta? Unapredi Dom starešina)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap the red threat line at the top."
msgstr "Dodirni crvenu liniju pretnje na vrhu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Pick a horde and tap Send scouts."
msgstr "Izaberi hordu i dodirni Pošalji izviđače."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Clear your first camp"
msgstr "Očisti svoj prvi logor"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Send an army to storm a bandit camp or a lair (order: storm it)."
msgstr "Pošalji vojsku da juriša na razbojnički logor ili jazbinu (naredba: juriš)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"A camp of beasts in the woods is a wave that has not yet happened. Burn it out.\""
msgstr "„Logor zveri u šumi je talas koji se još nije desio. Spali ga.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Find a camp on the map: there is one near your village (the tents)."
msgstr "Nađi logor na mapi: jedan je blizu tvog sela (šatori)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Tap it, choose your troops in the sheet and order them to storm it."
msgstr "Dodirni ga, izaberi trupe na listu i naredi im da ga napadnu."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Gift a teammate"
msgstr "Daruj saveznika"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Send a caravan to a teammate's village or to the Holy City vault."
msgstr "Pošalji karavan u selo saveznika ili u riznicu Svetog grada."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"No village stands alone. What you share now comes back to you on the night the walls shake.\""
msgstr "„Nijedno selo ne stoji samo. Ono što sada podeliš vratiće ti se u noći kad se zidovi zatresu.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Build a Caravan Yard on a free plot in the village (no free plot? Upgrade the Elder's Hall: each level opens one)."
msgstr "Izgradi Karavansko dvorište na slobodnom mestu u selu (nema slobodnog mesta? Unapredi Dom starešina: svaki nivo otvara jedno)."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Open the Caravans tab."
msgstr "Otvori karticu Karavani."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Load resources and send them to a teammate or to the Holy City vault."
msgstr "Natovari resurse i pošalji ih saigraču ili u riznicu Svetog grada."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Fill the Holy City's vault"
msgstr "Napuni riznicu Svetog grada"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Send a caravan of resources to the Holy City vault."
msgstr "Pošalji karavan sa resursima u riznicu Svetog grada."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "\"The Holy City feeds the bridge and the guard on its walls. What you send now comes back to you on the night the walls shake.\""
msgstr "„Sveti grad hrani most i stražu na svojim zidinama. Ono što pošalješ sada vratiće ti se one noći kad se zidine zatresu.“"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Load resources and send them to the Holy City vault."
msgstr "Natovari resurse i pošalji ih u riznicu Svetog grada."

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "Ready for the hordes"
msgstr "Spreman za horde"

#: data/onboarding.json
msgid "The elder nods at last. \"Now you know the ways of the steppe and the forest. The rest you will learn from the hordes themselves.\""
msgstr "Starešina konačno klimne glavom. „Sada znaš puteve stepe i šume. Ostalo ćeš naučiti od samih hordi.“"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Ambush the horde's road"
msgstr "Zaseda na putu horde"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Fell trees across the road and burn the fords: the next horde from the {front} sets out later."
msgstr "Obori drveće preko puta i spali gazove: sledeća horda sa {front} kreće kasnije."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Ride beyond the border"
msgstr "Jahanje preko granice"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Count the next horde from the {front} with your own eyes: its size, its troops and its stance."
msgstr "Svojim očima prebroj sledeću hordu sa {front}: njenu veličinu, trupe i stav."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Find the lost caravan"
msgstr "Pronađi izgubljeni karavan"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "A merchant's train went missing in the woods. Bring back what is left of it."
msgstr "Trgovački karavan je nestao u šumi. Vrati ono što je od njega ostalo."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "The smith's hoard"
msgstr "Kovačevo blago"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "An old smith buried his best work under his hearth before the hordes came. Dig it up."
msgstr "Stari kovač je zakopao svoje najbolje delo pod ognjište pre dolaska hordi. Iskopaj ga."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Search the ruins"
msgstr "Pretraži ruševine"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Search the {site} in person: nothing guards it now."
msgstr "Lično pretraži {site}: sada ga niko ne čuva."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Hunt the great boar"
msgstr "Ulovi velikog vepra"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "A boar the size of an ox tramples the fields. Bring it down and feast the village."
msgstr "Vepar velik kao vo gazi njive. Obori ga i nahrani selo gozbom."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Collect the hill clans' tribute"
msgstr "Pokupi danak brdskih plemena"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "The hill clans owe tribute since the last horde was turned back. Ride out and bring it home."
msgstr "Brdska plemena duguju danak otkad je poslednja horda odbijena. Odjaši i donesi ga kući."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Pilgrimage to Perun's oak"
msgstr "Hodočašće do Perunovog hrasta"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Keep vigil a night and a day under the thunder god's oak, and come back wiser."
msgstr "Bdi noć i dan pod hrastom gromovnika i vrati se mudriji."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Break the raiders' warband"
msgstr "Razbij družinu pljačkaša"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Raiders gather in the wilds to fall on your roads. Take the army and scatter them before they strike."
msgstr "Pljačkaši se okupljaju u divljini da napadnu tvoje puteve. Povedi vojsku i rasteraj ih pre nego što udare."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Hunt down the Nav warlord"
msgstr "Ulovi gospodara rata iz Navi"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "A warlord of Nav has made a den in the borderland. Lead the army against him and his guard."
msgstr "Gospodar rata iz Navi napravio je jazbinu u pograničju. Povedi vojsku na njega i njegovu stražu."

#: data/quests.json
msgid "Storm the haunted barrow"
msgstr "Juriš na ukleti kurgan"

#: data/quests.json
msgid "The dead walk around a chieftain's barrow, and his grave goods lie within. Break their ring and search it."
msgstr "Mrtvi hodaju oko poglavičinog kurgana, a njegovi grobni darovi leže unutra. Probij njihov krug i pretraži ga."

#: data/raids.json
msgid "Horde Encampment"
msgstr "Logor horde"

#: data/raids.json
msgid "Frozen Marsh"
msgstr "Zaleđena močvara"

#: data/raids.json
msgid "Dark Thicket"
msgstr "Mračna šikara"

#: data/raids.json
msgid "Bone Hills"
